<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>故障排查 on Hex Blog</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/tags/%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5/</link><description>Recent content in 故障排查 on Hex Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><managingEditor>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</managingEditor><webMaster>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</webMaster><copyright>©2026, All Rights Reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 25 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hex-go.github.io/tags/%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>K8s网络-排障思路与常用命令</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-09-25-k8s%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C-%E6%8E%92%E9%9A%9C%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8E%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 25 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-09-25-k8s%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C-%E6%8E%92%E9%9A%9C%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8E%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>系列导航 本系列从 Pod 网络连通入手，逐步展开到 K8s 网络全景。 ① 概念 → ② Flannel → ③ Calico → ④ 流量路径 → ⑤ Cilium → ⑥ 对比 → ⑦ 排障 ‖ ⑧ 开发 → ⑨ 多网卡 → ⑩ AI 演进 顺序 文</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>CNI</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s网络</category></item><item><title>Flannel 版本与 5.15 内核不兼容导致跨节点 Pod 无法通信</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-29-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-6-flannel%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8E5.15%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%BC%E5%AE%B9%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%B7%A8%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9pod%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 29 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-29-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-6-flannel%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8E5.15%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%BC%E5%AE%B9%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E8%B7%A8%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9pod%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>重要 Flannel v0.13.0 在 Linux 5.15 内核下，VXLAN 的 checksum offload 功能导致校验和计算错误，报文携带 bad udp cksum 被丢弃，跨节点 Pod 无法通信。 环境说明 OS: Ubuntu 22.04, 内核 5.15.0-79-generic rke v1.2.6, K8s v1.19.8, canal (flannel v0.13.0 + calico)</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>CNI</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>sudo echo 重定向报权限拒绝的原因与处理</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-4-sudo%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83echo%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-4-sudo%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83echo%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF/</guid><description>重要 sudo echo 'xxx' &amp;gt;&amp;gt; /etc/hosts 会报权限拒绝。原因：sudo 只作用于 echo，&amp;gt;&amp;gt; 重定向由当前 shell 以普通用户权限打开文件。 1.简介 Kubelet 集群部署时需要修</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Linux</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Linux</category><category>Bash</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>故障排查--ExternalDNS只开放UDP53不开放TCP53导致网络超时</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-21-%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5--externaldns%E5%8F%AA%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEudp53%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEtcp53%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 20 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-21-%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5--externaldns%E5%8F%AA%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEudp53%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEtcp53%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6/</guid><description>重要 DNS 协议在响应包超过 512 字节时，会自动切换到 TCP 传输。如果 DNS Server 只开放 UDP 53 端口，部分解析请求会被截断，客户端重试 TCP 超时后才会 fallback。 环</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item></channel></rss>